# {{ mosaics.short_title }} – agent guide

Each annual item contains {{ n_assets }} analysis COGs on ETRS89-LAEA
(EPSG:3035) at {{ analysis_grid.resolution | int }} m, plus {{ n_viz }} PMTiles archives for web maps.

## Grid and analysis

The extent is a fixed constant, so every year has identical `proj:shape` and
`proj:transform`. Stack years without alignment or resampling. The grid is
equal-area: multiply a pixel count by {{ (analysis_grid.resolution ** 2) | int }} m² to calculate area.

```python
import odc.stac
import pystac

collection = pystac.Collection.from_file(
    "{{ public_base }}/mosaics/collection.json"
)
cube = odc.stac.load(
    list(collection.get_items(recursive=True)),
    bands=["coh12_vv", "coh12_vh"],
    chunks={},
)
change = cube.sel(time="{{ last_year }}") - cube.sel(time="{{ first_year }}")
```

Read COGs for analysis. Values are linear; `*_qa_num` contains mean observation
counts. See the [root guide](../AGENTS.md#interpret-values) for units and nodata.

